// What a person shares with the world's NPCs: hands that hold four things
// rather than `sprout.Actor`'s eight. Restating `:capacity` makes
// `Creature` its origin, and a kind that composes `Creature` and, through
// `sprout.Visitor`, `sprout.Actor` as well takes `Creature`'s, since
// `Creature` composes the origin it restated.
kind Creature is sprout.Actor {
  :capacity 4
}
